.TH SDL_LockJoysticks 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_LockJoysticks \- Locking for atomic access to the joystick API.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_joystick.h>
.PP
.BI "void SDL_LockJoysticks(void);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
The SDL joystick functions are thread-safe, however you can lock the joysticks while processing to guarantee that the joystick list won\(aqt change and joystick and gamepad events will not be delivered\[char46]

.SH THREAD SAFETY
It is safe to call this function from any thread\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This function is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

